ode regulator supports the downstream 220uF modem bulk bank.\nType II: 1k / 100nF, 1nF high-frequency pole. Include eFuse resistance and both banks\nin loop analysis. Verify loop, burst droop, soft-start and thermal behavior on hardware.\n5A is a provisional burst design allocation. The selected 1A/power-contact M.2 socket permits\n5A total at 25C; sharing, hot derating and module envelope require qualification.\nThis is not a guaranteed current envelope for RM551E-GL or Sierra mmWave accessories." (at 25.4 294.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "a8c55f9e-69a7-5fe6-966f-a769d019038a"))(symbol (lib_id "Appliance:TPS259474L_RPW") (at 660.4 86.36 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "718c3c05-12c6-5b90-ae7a-b0cbeb748f17") (property "Reference" "U1902" (at 660.4 50.800000000000004 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))(property "Value" "TPS259474LRPWR" (at 660.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))(property "Footprint" "Appliance:VQFN-10_L2.0-W2.0-P0.45-TL" (at 660.4 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))(property "MPN" "TPS259474LRPWR" (at 660.4 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))(property "Manufacturer" "Texas Instruments" (at 660.4 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))(property "LCSC" "C2864845" (at 660.4 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))(property "Datasheet" "https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps25947.pdf" (at 660.4 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))(property "Fault Response" "Latch off; EN low/high clears. Reverse-current blocking always." (at 660.4 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))(instances (project "modem-power" (path "/ef2c0372-fa23-5a28-afcc-3a9112a9cf5b" (reference "U1902") (unit 1))) (project "appliance" (path "/4be0941e-e923-51bb-85b8-e69833501985/809a6bc5-4e43-5535-bcdc-02983cd794a2" (reference "U1902") (unit 1)))))(wire (pts (xy 637.54 81.28) (xy 627.38 81.28)) (stroke (width 0) (type default))