-5a1e-a26c-45a3f2c73e7b"))(wire (pts (xy 769.62 403.86) (xy 769.62 414.02)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "74dc0e78-d15c-56e7-a66f-5e7fc20bbaa9"))(global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 769.62 414.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "5935e5fe-efaa-5ea5-ac57-5f8d3748497d"))(text "U1903 is powered from always-on 3.3V; output threshold nominal 3.249V.\nCT via 100k to VDD: 180–420ms delay exceeds Sierra 100ms no-drive interval.\nMODEM_RAIL_GOOD drives data isolation and MCU PB13 (pad25). MCU PA0 controls power.\nLow command enables Q1901 discharge; wait at least 1s and bench-verify socket <0.1V\nbefore restart. MCU default/high-Z command is off. Qualify timing per modem profile.\nClear a latched fault only after determining cause; do not create an autonomous reset loop." (at 25.4 508 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "025cd8d5-150e-57c8-85f7-259ae61f83b7")))
